# Written by agents-runner the first time it ran here.
#
# Everything under .agents-runner/ is machine-local run history — job event
# logs alone are megabytes per execution — except config.json, which is project
# configuration worth sharing with the team.
#
# Delete this file if you would rather manage the rules yourself: it is only
# created when absent, never overwritten.
*
!.gitignore
!config.json
